    "note": "As in the other files. The eastern satrapies, Babylonia included, were run by his eldest son Seleucus as viceroy and co-regent from c. 275 until Antiochus put him to death in 268/7 (Wikipedia, Antiochus I Soter); Antiochus II followed as co-regent. Confidence medium.",
